{'symbol': 'TRV', 'date': '2023-02-22 09:00:00', 'title': 'TRAVELERS INSTITUTE ANNOUNCES SPRING 2023 VIRTUAL PROGRAMMING', 'text': 'HARTFORD, CONN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE TRAVELERS INSTITUTE, THE PUBLIC POLICY DIVISION OF THE TRAVELERS COMPANIES, INC. (NYSE: TRV), TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS WEDNESDAYS WITH WOODWARD® SPRING 2023 VIRTUAL PROGRAMMING SCHEDULE. THE WEBINAR SERIES, HOSTED BY JOAN WOODWARD, PRESIDENT OF THE TRAVELERS INSTITUTE AND EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT OF PUBLIC POLICY AT TRAVELERS, EXAMINES PRESSING TOPICS AT THE INTERSECTION OF INSURANCE, BUSINESS AND PUBLIC POLICY.'}